 ver:'v2.1.121',date:'2026-05-16',cats:['feature','polish','beta-tester'],reporter:'Amper',title:'đź“˛ [Amper] Dwunasta fala â€” rozszerzenia phone apps (S49 Tidal/YT + S51 Bank invest history)',
