 {
 ver:'v2.1.119',date:'2026-05-16',cats:['bugfix','polish','beta-tester'],reporter:'Amper',title:'âś¨ [Amper] DziesiÄ…ta fala â€” gym cooldown + verify reszty audytu (W60/K71/N17 design choices + S22-S38 done)',
 items:[
  {t:'fix',d:'âś¨ **Finalne fixes + verify**: (1) **W7 W74 Gym per-session cooldown 8s** â€” bench press + treadmill `window._lastGymStart` real-time tracker. Anti-spam UI feel. (2) **W6 W60 skillPoints reset Prestige** â€” DESIGN CHOICE (niewydane SP zachowane jako prestige reward â€” gracz wraca silniejszy). Nie reset. (3) **W7 K71 Choice event outcomes** â€” VERIFIED CLOSED (`G._lastChoiceEventDay=G.day` set PRZED `ev.fn()` linia 10681 â€” quit-load tego samego dnia NIE moĹĽe powtĂłrzyÄ‡). (4) **W6 N17 Achievements rendering perf** â€” VERIFIED ACCEPTABLE (~104 items Ă— O(n log n) sort = ~1ms, future-safe). (5) **W6 N19 Rep system inconsistent** â€” DESIGN: Pizza/kurier/construction = "uliczne" prace dajÄ…ce rep, Supermarket/carwash/zmywak = "civil" prace bez rep (intentional differentiation). (6) **W8 N23/N24 Pantry expiry/cap** â€” DESIGN: gracz zna co kupuje, brak expiry to QoL. (7) **W3 W31 v2.1.83 max stack docs** â€” info-level minor. (8) **W3 W32 Bank investment Prestige** â€” DESIGN CHOICE (totalRet jest jednorazowy zysk, ROI cap 2Ă— chroni przed exploit). (9) **W8 S62 casino_jackpot tier** â€” DONE w v2.1.110 (TIER_MEDIUM). (10) **W8 S63 LodĂłwka regen v2.1.48** â€” INFO/research item (juĹĽ funkcjonalne). (11) **W8 S64 Fans format merge** â€” design (one-time migration safe). (12) **W5 N15 Cooking SKILL_DEF** â€” DONE w v2.1.105. (13) **W8 W83 NPC despawn rotation** â€” DESIGN/perf (current 25 NPC pool, ~12.5KB negligible, refresh dziennie nie potrzebne). LecÄ™ dalej audyt na 100% w v2.1.120+ jeĹ›li pojawiÄ… siÄ™ nowe issues.'},
 ]
 },
 {
 ver:'v2.1.118',date:'2026-05-16',cats:['bugfix','polish','feature','beta-tester'],reporter:'Amper',title:'đźš€ [Amper] DziewiÄ…ta fala cleanup â€” Wave 6/7/8 (tournament cap + drip cinematic + outfit prac + radio active + NPC scale)',
 items:[
  {t:'fix',d:'đźš€ **Wave 6/7/8 napraw**: (1) **W7 K67 Tournament daily cap 3** â€” wczeĹ›niej brak limitu (gaming career, cooldown OK â€” nie jest pracÄ… dorywczÄ…). Daily tracker `G._tourneysToday`. (2) **W4 S33 Drip God + 9 inne TIER_LEGENDARY achievementĂłw cinematic** â€” `showMilestoneCinematic` zamiast popup (drip_200, fans_1m, 1m_followers, prestige5, million_plays, tracks_50, penthouse, casino_whale, casino_megajackpot, cover_legend). Plus sfxJackpot fanfare. (3) **W4 S38 Day-summary timeout** â€” VERIFIED CLOSED (optional chaining `?.remove()` safe). (4) **W6 S52 outfit bonus prac** â€” sport/sport_pro aplikuje +3%/+5% do construction/kurier/carwash (prace fizyczne). (5) **W6 S53 Holiday bonus prac** â€” Sylwester +10%, Walentynki +5% (moraĹ‚-boost). (6) **W6 S54 G._deaths display** â€” VERIFIED CLOSED (juĹĽ w stats L29301). (7) **W6 N18 daily quest anti-repeat** â€” `G._lastDailyQuestTarget` zapobiega tym samym target 2 dni z rzÄ™du. (8) **W6 W68 Radio platform AKTYWNE** â€” daily growth (plays += beats Ă— fame Ă— 0.5 Ă— freshArtist) + viral radio event "Viral radio hit" (1% chance, 5+ beats, +500-2500 plays, +money, +2 fame). (9) **W8 W82 NPC speed scaling** â€” `baseSpd = 0.9 + min(0.27, levelĂ—0.005)`. Lvl 1 â†’ 0.9, lvl 50 â†’ 1.17 (+30% gradient â€” NPC szybciej w late game).'},
