 {
 ver:'v2.1.115',date:'2026-05-16',cats:['bugfix','beta-tester'],reporter:'Amper',title:'đź›  [Amper] SzĂłsta fala cleanup â€” Wave 3+4 defensive inits + missing stopAutoSave + Friend error handling + W47 keydown leak',
 items:[
  {t:'fix',d:'đź›  **Wave 3 + Wave 4 issues**: (1) **W26-W28 + S17-S19 + K21 + K28 defensive inits** w `loadGame`: 18 nowych guard\'Ăłw dla wszystkich krytycznych pĂłl (G.sideQuests, G._ytStreak, G._ytLastUploadDay, G._lastConcertAbs, G._concertsCounter, G.activeHoliday, G.activeFestival, G._eventCounts, G._lastChoiceEventDay, G._introductionSeen, G._lastBeatSellAbs, G._lastBeatPackAbs, G._lastHealAbs, G._magazineCovers, G._achievementsClaimed, G._streamBoostExpiresDay, G._cinematicCompleted + 7 pĂłl mixer/master + G.yt full structure). Stare save\'y od v1.x crashowaĹ‚y na undefined w nowych mechanikach. (2) **W4 W38 stopAutoSave** â€” function byĹ‚a REFERENCED w returnToMenu (linia 29033) ale **NIEZDEFINIOWANA!** Teraz zdefiniowana + exposed window.stopAutoSave. Auto-save timer wyciekaĹ‚ przy multi-prestige (kaĹĽdy startAutoSave tworzyĹ‚ nowy interval bez stopu starego). (3) **W4 W43 Friend request error handling** â€” try/catch dla `addFriend()` Supabase. Offline mode â†’ "âťŚ Brak poĹ‚Ä…czenia z serwerem" zamiast silent fail. (4) **W4 W44 Friend request rate limit** â€” 60s cooldown per-user (anti-spam zaproszeĹ„). (5) **W4 W47 YouTube MG rhythm minigame keydown cleanup** â€” `_ytMgCleanup` callback usuwa listener przy early exit (wczeĹ›niej memory leak gdy gracz wyjdzie z MG przed czasem). FPS shooter (15297) nie uĹĽywa keydown â€” OK. Race (15499) ma cleanup â€” OK. (6) **W4 W39 VIP unlock cinematic guard** â€” VERIFIED CLOSED (v2.0.3 fix). (7) **W2 K17 Smart Hints** â€” VERIFIED CLOSED (false positive Wave 2).'},
 ]
 },
